  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0-preview adds local PIXIE neural sparse encoding and an experimental in-memory sparse/dense hybrid store. Includes the pinned model converted to 8-bit weights, tokenizer, provenance and license. No Python server or runtime download is required. The index is memory-only; this preview does not replace existing search defaults. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag.Search.Pixie/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v010-preview",
